  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n76.jpg">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="93" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/93"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/93/1" n="1"/>The Lord reigns, clothed in majesty, the Lord clothes Himself in strength, He girds Himself. Surely the world stands firm without shaking. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/93/2" n="2"/>Thy throne is established from of old, since eternity art Thou. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/93/3" n="3"/>The streams, O Lord, the streams have raised their voice, the streams shall raise their roar. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/93/4" n="4"/>Mightier than many waters are the breakers of the sea but still mightier on high is the Lord. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/93/5" n="5"/>Thy testimonies are indeed sure, holiness becomes Thine House, O Lord, for an infinity of days. <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/></tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
